<title>USA: Cost Plus Inc Nov same-store sales off.</title>
<headline>Cost Plus Inc Nov same-store sales off.</headline>
<dateline>OAKLAND, Calif. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$24.6	$22.3     +10.3	 -2.6</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $148.8     $126.0     +18.1	 +3.8</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>1996 month is 4 weeks ended November 30.</p>
<p>November 1995 sales figure is based on 5 weeks versus 4 in November 1996. When both months are based on 4 weeks, November 1996 same-store sales increased 16.4 pct from year ago, and year-to-date same-store sales rose 8.2 pct.</p>
</text>
